Package: lpanel
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Laika IT <packages@laika.invalid>
Depends: nginx, php-fpm, php-cli, php-mysql, php-intl, php-mbstring, mariadb-server, mariadb-client, openssl, iproute2, passwd, libpam0g, libc6
Recommends: systemd, logrotate
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/laikait/lpanel
Description: LPanel hosting control panel
 The panel: people sign in on port 8443, and the LPanel agents on managed
 servers connect to port 8444 with mutual TLS. It runs on its own Nginx and
 PHP-FPM masters, separate from any hosting Nginx or PHP-FPM on the machine,
 keeps its data in a local MariaDB database, and lets root sign in with this
 machine's root password through a small PAM helper.
